  "sourceTitle": "Kidney Bean Salad",
  "sourceText": "Kidney Bean Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 20, 2009 - 12:11am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 can 15 oz. can Van Camps light red kidney beans, drained\n2 pieces hard boiled eggs, chopped\n1/4 cup sweet pickle relish, drained\n2 tablespoons sliced green onions\n2 tablespoons mayonnaise\n1/2 teaspoon prepared mustard\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients, 2 Chill at least 1 hour before serving 3 Salt and pepper to taste 4 Pour 1/2 cup servings.",
